  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering and Increasing Resilience of Civil Society Organizations to Assist GBV and TIP Survivors In Azerbaijan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to empower and strengthen the resilience of civil society organizations in Azerbaijan to enable them to provide quality, timely and gender- and child-sensitive services to persons vulnerable to gender-based violence (GBV) and trafficking in persons (TIP) and survivors of GBV and TIP, irrespective of gender, age, disabilities and legal status and protect them from violence, exploitation and abuse. This will be done by strengthening partnerships and coordination across Government and non-government agencies and increasing the capacities and resources of CSOs in Azerbaijan.</narrative>
  </description>
